# Browser
# Fabrication Foundry at a table, Bot1 a browser page: "{2}{W}, {T}, Exile one or more other artifacts you control with total mana value X:
# Return target artifact card with mana value X or less from your graveyard to the battlefield." X, set by no mana symbol, is announced with the
# page's stepper as the ability is activated (CR 601.2b by way of 602.2b), the target is chosen next, after X (CR 601.2c), and the artifacts the
# cost exiles are clicked as it is paid (CR 601.2h), their total mana value exactly X (CR 118.3).
# Turn 1 Bot1 builds three Moxen, a Sol Ring (mana value 1) and the Foundry, and sacrifices a Mishra's Bauble (0) to its graveyard. On turn 3
# the Sol Ring's {C}{C} and a Plains pay {2}{W}; X = 1 is announced, the Bauble targeted, and the tapped Sol Ring alone is exiled for the
# total of 1. The Bauble returns.

